# Vendored upstream source trees extracted from pinned tarballs.  The pinned
# tarball + .sums (+ patches/ + README once ports land) are committed; the
# extraction is rebuilt from the tarball — WebKit is ~525 MiB extracted and
# tracks in its own fork repo (browser.md AD-11/Appendix C).
third_party/wpewebkit-2.54.0/
# L5 font stack (browser.md §2/Appendix C): tarball + .sha256 + README
# committed per pin; extractions rebuilt from the tarballs, build trees under
# the already-ignored obj/third_party/.
third_party/freetype-2.14.3/
third_party/harfbuzz-14.5.0/
third_party/fonts/dejavu-2.37/

# L6 host-first library builds (browser/l6-libs1 — zlib / libpng /
# libjpeg-turbo / libwebp, browser.md §2 carried pins + §7.1 L6): the pinned
# tarball + .sha256/.sig + README + build.sh + smoke/ are committed; the
# extracted upstream tree and the host build tree are rebuilt from the
# tarball by each library's build.sh.
third_party/zlib-1.3.1/src/
third_party/zlib-1.3.1/build-host/
third_party/libpng-1.6.44/src/
third_party/libpng-1.6.44/build-host/
third_party/libjpeg-turbo-3.1.0/src/
third_party/libjpeg-turbo-3.1.0/build-host/
third_party/libwebp-1.6.0/src/
third_party/libwebp-1.6.0/build-host/

